<h1>Your deposit could not be approved</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.full_name %>,</p>

<p>
  Unfortunately we were unable to approve your deposit of
  <%= number_to_currency(@deposit.amount_usd) %> (<%= @deposit.btc_amount %> BTC)
  toward the <strong><%= @plan.name %></strong> plan.
</p>

<% if @deposit.admin_notes.present? %>
  <p><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= @deposit.admin_notes %></p>
<% end %>

<p>
  If you believe this was a mistake, or you'd like to submit a new deposit,
  you can view your deposit history:
  <%= link_to "View deposits", deposits_url %>
</p>
